OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786000684
OL,3,CMichael Rosen urges book authors to
OL,4,Ccreate 'special pleasures' that
OL,5,Cscreens lack
OL,7,FChildren's author Michael Rosen has
OL,8,Fsaid writers have got to "try harder"
OL,9,Fand create "special pleasures" from
OL,10,Freading a book that youngsters cannot
OL,11,Fget from a screen.
OL,13,FOn Wednesday, Rosen read his popular
OL,14,Fbook We're Going on a Bear Hunt to a
OL,15,Fsmall group of children on a train
OL,16,Ffrom London Paddington to Reading as
OL,17,Fhe helped launch Great Western
OL,18,FRailway's campaign to encourage
OL,19,Fyoungsters to keep reading during
OL,20,Fsummer holidays.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
