OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786000684
OL,3,CMichael Rosen urges book authors to
OL,4,Ccreate 'special pleasures' that
OL,5,Cscreens lack
OL,7,FThe train company has added mini
OL,8,Flibraries to stations across its
OL,9,Fnetwork after a survey of more than
OL,10,F1,000 parents showed their children
OL,11,Fspent an average of 11 hours before
OL,12,Fscreens per week during the break from
OL,13,Fschool, compared to three hours a week
OL,14,Fof reading.
OL,16,FIt comes amid the Government's
OL,17,Fnational year of reading, which aims
OL,18,Fto tackle the decline in children and
OL,19,Fyoung people's enjoyment of reading,
OL,20,Fwhich hit a 20-year low last year.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786000684
OL,3,CMichael Rosen urges book authors to
OL,4,Ccreate 'special pleasures' that
OL,5,Cscreens lack
OL,7,FRosen said: "We are in this world. I
OL,8,Fuse a screen, I type on screen, I look
OL,9,Fup information, I read things on the
OL,10,Fscreen.
OL,12,F"The question is: are there these
OL,13,Fspecial pleasures and special rewards
OL,14,Ffrom reading a book that maybe you
OL,15,Fcan't get on a screen?"
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786000684
OL,3,CMichael Rosen urges book authors to
OL,4,Ccreate 'special pleasures' that
OL,5,Cscreens lack
OL,7,FNew measures to curb the hours
OL,8,Fchildren spend on their devices, and
OL,9,Fprotect them from online harms, were
OL,10,Fannounced by the Government under Sir
OL,11,FKeir Starmer this summer ` including a
OL,12,Fsocial media ban for under-16s which
OL,13,Fwas set to come into force by next
OL,14,Fspring.
OL,16,FRosen added: "I'm not generally in
OL,17,Ffavour of bans. I'm not sure that that
OL,18,Fwill necessarily achieve what they
OL,19,Fwould hope to achieve.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786000684
OL,3,CMichael Rosen urges book authors to
OL,4,Ccreate 'special pleasures' that
OL,5,Cscreens lack
OL,7,F"If you forbid something, you make it
OL,8,Fdesirable, so there's a bit of a
OL,9,Fproblem with that: 'Oh, I'm being
OL,10,Fnaughty. I'm looking at the screen'.
OL,12,F"That would have been my attitude if I
OL,13,Fwas 12, I know I was that kind of kid,
OL,14,Fso that might be counter-productive.
OL,16,F"What I always say to other authors is
OL,17,Fwe've got to try harder.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786000684
OL,3,CMichael Rosen urges book authors to
OL,4,Ccreate 'special pleasures' that
OL,5,Cscreens lack
OL,7,F"We've got to make our books funnier,
OL,8,Fcleverer, sadder, more intriguing.
OL,9,FWe've got to think about why it would
OL,10,Fbe fun to come to this book.
OL,12,F"Maybe we've got to make books so that
OL,13,Fthey're very performable, that would
OL,14,Fbe something. Maybe we've got to
OL,15,Fcreate these special pleasures that
OL,16,Fmaybe the screens can't find.
OL,18,F"So, we've got to just try harder.
OL,19,FThat's what I always say to myself
OL,20,Fanyway."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786000684
OL,3,CMichael Rosen urges book authors to
OL,4,Ccreate 'special pleasures' that
OL,5,Cscreens lack
OL,7,FHe referred to the success of Dav
OL,8,FPilkey's The Adventures of Captain
OL,9,FUnderpants and Dog Man books, as well
OL,10,Fas Cressida Cowell's How to Train Your
OL,11,FDragon series which was turned into a
OL,12,Ffilm franchise.
OL,14,F"People want to watch the movies and
OL,15,Fread the books," Rosen said.
OL,17,F"For adults, they go to see The
OL,18,FOdyssey, what happens? The sales of
OL,19,FThe Odyssey as a book go through the
OL,20,Fceiling.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786000684
OL,3,CMichael Rosen urges book authors to
OL,4,Ccreate 'special pleasures' that
OL,5,Cscreens lack
OL,7,F"We have to do the same thing for
OL,8,Fchildren. We sometimes have to think
OL,9,Fmass media, the digital media, are
OL,10,Fdoing this, how can we do stuff that
OL,11,Frelates to it, or might be a spin-off?
OL,12,FIt might be anything like that, so
OL,13,Fwe've got to be creative."
OL,15,FMini libraries have been set up in
OL,16,FReading, Exeter St Davids, Swindon,
OL,17,FPenzance, Worcester Parkway, Didcot
OL,18,FParkway, Westbury, Plymouth, Truro and
OL,19,FGloucester.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
