PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786000684
OL,3,CMichael Rosen urges book authors to
OL,4,Ccreate 'special pleasures' that
OL,5,Cscreens lack
OL,7,FThe survey behind the campaign found
OL,8,Fone in five respondents noticed their
OL,9,Fchildren actively struggle with words
OL,10,Fin September that they knew well at
OL,11,Fthe end of the school term.
OL,13,FMore than a quarter of parents also
OL,14,Freported it takes an average of three
OL,15,Fto four weeks of the autumn term to
OL,16,Fget their child's reading confidence
OL,17,Fback to pre-summer levels.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
